2026-07-27T07:49:28.6150430Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T07:49:28.6219821Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:49:28.6220821Z i /tmp/RtmpEum1vt/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:49:28.6221288Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:49:28.6221851Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:49:28.6222813Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:49:28.6223627Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:49:28.6225012Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:49:28.6225848Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:49:28.6484575Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:49:28.6601496Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:49:28.7058307Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:49:28.7237475Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
